{"server":"cn","storyId":"main_13_level_main_13-19_beg","groupId":"main_13","stageId":"main_13-19","title":"殷红君主","storyCode":"13-21","avgTag":"行动前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_13-19_beg.txt","sourceHash":"19ff06905106ba8412083fd6cd689531862e2c5b69a9c5a0bed611aff0a418cc","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"43_g4_spinestops_ex"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"在几个瞬间，也许是更多的瞬间，没有一位萨卡兹敢于开口言语。\n\\n它是褫夺了一切之物，也是塑造了一切之物。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那是......什么......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"血魔大君先前留给萨卡兹的祝福仍未褪去，但刚才——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"难道博士他们说的是指......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"有血从巨兽的脊椎中扬起，似乎只有一滴，但它却吸引了所有人的注意。\n\\n它离开了交错的骨殖，飞舞于暗淡的洞窟，升腾在刚刚洒落的阳光里。\n\\n一滴血，仅仅只有一滴血。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"澄净的血——\n\\n辉煌的血。\n\\n它曾被伤害，它曾被背离，它曾被遗忘，以至于被唾弃。\n\\n万年来，大地以它为灾厄，视它为仇敌，蹂躏它，践踏它，直到它真的舍去了自己的荣耀，污浊了自己的身躯。\n提卡兹变为萨卡兹，家园从此无从寻觅。\n\\n今日，“拥有家园之人”的血终从历史中归来。\n\\n这片大地上的所有人，需为此致意。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"血珠消融，寂静无声。\n\\n没有爆鸣，没有震动，没有瑰丽的异象或狂乱的低语。\n哪怕被山体阻隔，所有人也都望向了伦蒂尼姆的方向。\n\\n这一刻起，碎片大厦曾招来的所有风暴，都仿佛只是无害的细雨。\n\\n如今在那座塔顶聚集的，已经无法仅仅被称呼为阴云。\n\\n风暴已成为襁褓。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"43_g4_spinestops_ex"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"脊椎守卫","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......赫德雷，W，别发呆！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"趁现在！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"W，你埋的那些炸药呢？马上引爆！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不用你提醒！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别猜来猜去了，赫德雷，管它是什么，我们只应付自己能应付的对手！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我清楚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"W的炸弹撕开了守卫的防线，突围，我们被他们纠缠得太久了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米娅和Logos已经先我们一步了，他们会帮我们处理掉最麻烦的那个。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至于其他的......沿着他们开的路，从那些栈桥登上巨兽的骸骨！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"脊椎守卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"该死，这些家伙——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"脊椎守卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别再让他们继续通过！厄尔苏拉指挥官正在收起舷梯！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"战栗的神经束开始收拢，骨制的廊桥开始漂移。\n\\n巨兽决定拒绝再有人踏足它的脊梁。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"脊椎守卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"让叛徒死在这里！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"脊椎守卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这些混蛋的尸体会送去食腐者之王阁下的营帐，供养我们接下来的胜利！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"脊椎守卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在骨头下面埋雷，体验感还不错。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"赫德雷，伊内丝，准备好——冲击波来了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"如此盛大的爆炸，三名佣兵被猛然轰出的灼热气流卷起，甩向空中。\n\\n赫德雷艰难地调整着姿态，俯瞰着正在被火光吞噬的洞窟。\n\\n巨兽好像察觉了什么，它摆动身体，白骨的尾椎如同长鞭，划破历史的激流，向三人抽打过来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"W，三枚手雷，斜下方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好主意。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我最后一次这么配合你们的爆炸性胡闹。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"红发的萨卡兹搭建燃尘，黑发的卡普里尼编织晦暗。\n\\n以余烬为梁，以阴影做阶。\n\\n裹挟着火药气息的无形阶梯盘旋而起，刺入悬停骸骨的胸腔之间。\n\\n雇佣兵们冲入它空无的体内。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"43_g2_giantmonsterspine"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"走这边，这具骸骨的中枢就在这个方向。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们的目标是厄尔苏拉，找到她，拿下我们脚下这东西的控制权。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你俩确定这个骨架子真的可以被“拿下”？听起来轻率得简直就像是打劫商队。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"必须能。否则阿米娅和Logos的战斗会毫无意义。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以我们要拉开车门，把司机丢出去，拔下钥匙——“好，现在这辆车归我了”？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你看过了这东西激起的幻象，在它的骨骼之间穿行，却还什么都没有想到？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那可不是什么冷门故事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我该想到吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我忘了，你对历史故事不感兴趣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"数百年前，萨卡兹们曾杀死过一只险些毁灭了某座卡兹戴尔的巨兽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那只巨兽陨落之后，有关它去向的说法多种多样，其中有一条是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它的意识并未消亡，而是被分解，封印进了数件物品之中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在看来，这个说法恐怕确实是真相的一部分，至于那具失去了意识的空壳......在这场战争之前，都被某些人小心地收藏起来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们花了很大功夫来改造它，而它确实在这场战争中，为军事委员会派上了大用场。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“数件物品”。厄尔苏拉以前可没有揣着一只怀表的习惯，疤痕商场里就她从不守时。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过，如果她手上的怀表真的藏匿着这只巨兽的意识......它也很有可能已经极端破碎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们脚下的骸骨确实还“没有死亡”，但它只有最基础的神经反射。厄尔苏拉最多只能诱导这些基本反应的走向。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们只要注意那些——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"箭雨自骸骨的缝隙中落下，随即跟上的是萨卡兹巫术诡异的光芒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"找掩体！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄尔苏拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，只要躲开能砸人的神经束，小心突然刺出的骨矛，没什么别的了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄尔苏拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这家伙毕竟已经被剥得只剩这一具白骨架子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但还有你们呢，厄尔苏拉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们可比这半死不活的巨兽危险。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"终于忙完了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄尔苏拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你们不来打扰的话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这女人就是这里的指挥官？她对自己手下这具白骨架子可够狠的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这些箭，都钉进骨头里了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要我帮你们取出来吗？我倒是有个方便的办法。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"脊椎守卫","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳咳——那疯子！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄尔苏拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在我的面前，还想杀我的部下？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄尔苏拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"赫德雷，你也太不把我放在眼里了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"厄尔苏拉的指尖正凝出法术，危险而混乱的力量在她的手中聚集。\n\\n可在法术施放前的一瞬间，一道黑色的影子攀上了她的脚踝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄尔苏拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"厄尔苏拉只好向右侧迈开脚步，摆脱影子无止境的纠缠。\n\\n她手中的法术失控偏移，红色的光芒激射而出，从脊椎破损的缝隙中漏过。\n\\n远方山洞的岩壁上，传来沉闷的爆炸声。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你倒是比以前生疏了，厄尔苏拉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看来你在疤痕商场的日子相当不错。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄尔苏拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你们确实是活命的专家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄尔苏拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我还在卡兹戴尔的时候，经常和老家伙们私下打赌，赌你们参与的那些任务能有几个人领到最后的报酬。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄尔苏拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只要押赫德雷，伊内丝，后来还要加个疯子W，我就总能赢钱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这么说，你欠我们一大笔分成。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄尔苏拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你确实牙尖嘴利，“这一位W”，你没从伊内丝那学点好的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄尔苏拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但这次你们打错主意了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄尔苏拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"两位王庭之主在这里全力搏杀，还有，“魔王”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄尔苏拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄尔苏拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这里绝不再是总能逃出战争的你们，能够活下来的地方了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那么，你呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"特雷西斯在伦蒂尼姆的最终手段，你是不是早就有所耳闻？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"即使......那些东西带来的后果可能远超常识？你仍旧觉得，在这样的代价之上重建卡兹戴尔，对萨卡兹是有益的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄尔苏拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄尔苏拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不用废话了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄尔苏拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"士兵们，趁还有时间，把他们了结在这里。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"脊椎守卫","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"少校，你看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"脊椎守卫","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这里的骨头上......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"鲜血正沿着所有的骨头，匍匐爬行而来。\n\\n鲜血正填充这里，溢满这些破损的空隙，连接这具冰冷已久的身体。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄尔苏拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是血魔大君阁下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄尔苏拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看来他已经准备好了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"它......正在温暖起来。\n\\n骨骼中再次积蓄起力量，脊椎左右摇动，吱呀作响。\n\\n这只巨兽重新开始了游动。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......这么多的血。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"厄尔苏拉，这些血，是从哪里来的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这还用说，是他们那位杀人成瘾的血魔大君，把这里屠了个干净。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，他们的手腕......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"厄尔苏拉和她的部下们，手腕上都有一道还在滴着血的伤口。\n\\n滴答，滴答，一开始只是血珠，后来则是血的丝带，血的河流。\n\\n一个人的身体里到底有多少血？\n\\n守卫们身体中淌出的血，与白骨上正蔓延的血痕连接在了一起。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"脊椎守卫","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"“我将我的血奉献给您，鲜血王庭的主人。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"脊椎守卫","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"“愿您的猎杀无往不利。”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄尔苏拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“而我们的血，将为您架起，奔腾的车舆。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"厄尔苏拉！停下！你疯了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这只巨兽......它正准备游动！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们现在的位置，会被那些历史的乱流卷走！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这女人想和我们同归于尽——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄尔苏拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我没有在操纵它。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄尔苏拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"鲜血取代了肌肉，取代了韧带，取代了骨髓。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄尔苏拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它们还不够操纵它的吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"守卫们裸露在外的皮肤肉眼可见地苍白下去。厄尔苏拉的脸色也越来越差。\n\\n终于，流淌停止了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"萨卡兹的军人们会为主君奉献一切，何止于血。\n\\n他们的皮肤干瘪下去，他们终于倒下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄尔苏拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好伙计们，你们是陪我到最后的人了，我们会在众魂间相会。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄尔苏拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1067_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我说了，这具骸骨，不再是想要逃开的人，能够活下来的地方了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"快点！我们得先躲到舱室里！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"幻境已经开始浮现，我们不知道它会前往哪里！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——它掀起了浪！注意！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"43_g1_giantmonstercockpit"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啧，那血魔要把我们带去哪里？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_412_1","isRemote":false,"text":"赫德雷呢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我在这儿。还有她。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"失血过多，能不能活下来看她本事了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄尔苏拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你们大可把我留在舱室外，赫德雷，我宁愿和我的部下们死在一起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄尔苏拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你们干掉的“老相识”这么多，不会今天突然就发了善心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你还有用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄尔苏拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我说了，这具骸骨已经脱离了我的掌控。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你也说了，你忠于军事委员会。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你认为军事委员会，会是卡兹戴尔作为一个“国家”的依仗......那为什么，那个人还以摄政王自称？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么他还需要特蕾西娅？为什么他会觉得，打赢这场仗，卡兹戴尔就能有未来？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"特雷西斯到底在想什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄尔苏拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"算了，这些，等我们拿下这只巨兽后再谈吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄尔苏拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你们......要去做什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们的目的从未改变。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"回家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄尔苏拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......呵。“回家”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄尔苏拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这本来就是这具骸骨最后的任务。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄尔苏拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"它有一个名字，它的代号是“生命脊椎”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄尔苏拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"虽然很少被使用，但是曼弗雷德将军定下这个名字的时候......也和我说过和你一样的话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一样的话？曼弗雷德他......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄尔苏拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我们是敌人，我不会回答更多问题，我只等待我的死亡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄尔苏拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"再说，呵，你活到今天本身就是一种答案。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄尔苏拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"真当曼弗雷德将军是个睁眼瞎？一点看不出你们的小伎俩？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"厄尔苏拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不过，那也得等你们从血魔大君的手下活着离开后，才有资格继续谈论“回家”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说的没错。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那么——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"借你的怀表一用。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"也许是失血过多，厄尔苏拉几乎无力反抗。赫德雷轻易摘下了这只漂亮的怀表。它冰冷的金属外壳上雕刻着繁复的巫术纹样。\n\\n怀表在倒转。\n\\n无人能听见的呢喃一瞬间填满了他的脑海。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它确实......比我想象的吵闹。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"赫德雷咬紧牙关，将嘈杂的低语甩在身后。\n\\n他在其中寻觅着那只巨兽沉眠的，真实的意志。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在这片大地上游荡的巨兽，您还没死，您自己选择了换一种方式继续存在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您仍在这里，对吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_laccolith"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"灾难的中心，沉默的巨兽缓缓游动。它徜徉过的地方，只剩下破碎的虚无。\n\\n过往托举着它，未来被它分开。\n\\n一个人影站在它的面前。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年轻的血魔？","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"停下，巨兽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年轻的血魔？","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你即将涉足卡兹戴尔，我们的城市。那里的人们拒绝你的到访。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年轻的血魔？","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"另择他路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年轻的血魔？","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"否则，萨卡兹将屠戮你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年轻的血魔？","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是我们最后的警告。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巨兽","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年轻的血魔？","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年轻的血魔？","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的兄长命令我们禁绝它的前进，遵从魔王的意志。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年轻的血魔？","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"鲜血的王庭，向我奉献。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"强大的巫术在血魔的掌中凝集，猩红的巨枪自空中落下。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"一道又一道巨大的伤口贯穿了它。\n\\n始终沉默的巨兽终于发出了声音，如梦方醒。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"“卡兹戴尔......”\n\\n“啊......也许是我睡得太久了......”\n\\n“卡兹戴尔......什么时候......变成了一座城市？”\n\\n“你们的......‘魔王’，他不是你们唯一的天选的领袖吗......”\n\\n“为什么不是他......站在我的面前？”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"已无人记得的景象被游动的巨兽撞碎。\n\\n它已经数百年没有徜徉如此之久。\n它轻轻划动着仅剩下白骨的鳍，推开一层又一层空间。\n\\n曾杀死它的凶手如今却再度赐予了它温暖。\n\\n骸骨寻找着适合停下的地方。\n\\n终于——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"43_i04"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"巨大的骨骼正悬浮在一望无际的海面上。\n\\n洞窟，战场，乃至正缓缓升起的朝阳都已不见踪影。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"43_i04"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"取而代之的，却是......\n\\n平静的天空，平静的海，还有......平静的星辰。\n在大地上发生过的一切残忍仿佛都未曾在这里存在。\n\\n此为视野之外，此为文明之外。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"43_i04"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"此为，仅剩骸骨的它为鲜血之主最终找寻到的——\n\\n无人可以触及之境。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"43_g3_giantmonsterspinetop"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"殷红的河流与暗蓝的神经相连，彼此紧紧咬合。\n\\n纤弱的凶手闭着眼睛，感受着被害者磅礴的律动。\n\\n他以血做缰，驾驭起这只能徜徉于历史的生物。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"比起那些幻觉般的过往和记忆，你确实给我带来了一片......更有价值的景色。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"二位，面对如此景色，你们为何不先散去手中那些弱小又可笑的法术呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看看吧，看看周围，不妨花点时间欣赏一下——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是......我为你们选定的坟场。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"明明刚刚还是白天，可这里......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"黑夜，还有一望无际的海。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......星辰变幻。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我从未在任何典籍或传说里，听闻过这样的地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那么，这里只能是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"足够遥远的遥远。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，不知道我们离卡兹戴尔，已有多远。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这片被所有人唤为泰拉的土地，到底是太过宽阔，还是太过渺小呢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米娅，小心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他的血......在升华。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他借方才的巫术，唤醒了自己的血脉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别说得像局外人一样，女妖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你明明知道，我总是等同地对待纯净之人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也许，与耗费无数时光寻求净化的鲜血王庭相比，你还是被源石影响得太深。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是罢了，在萨卡兹之中，你也确实还算得上清澈，算得上......强大。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"来吧，别吝啬我的祝福，你无法拒绝我的礼物。凭借被我唤起的力量，你终于配得上与我抗衡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"让我听听如今丧钟的尖啸，是否还能令月色晦暗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"赤红的波纹漾开，此刻，天空不再是天空，海洋不再是海洋。\n\\n它们只是血的折射，血的倒影。\n血魔大君淡淡微笑，一片如心脏般的血魄在他的掌中跳动，如生命本身一般深邃的结构中，映照着女妖年轻的面容。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"随即，血魄破碎。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“我书写，则为我命令。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“黑夜为我遮过死亡。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......又是咒文。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"又是你这些浅薄的咒文。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你天赋异禀，这没错。你仅靠唇口念诵，靠骨笔书写，就足以睥睨庸人们可怜的源石“技艺”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，你对传承就如此抵触吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"向我展示你自己，王庭的主人，女妖！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"向我——血魔大君杜卡雷，一切鲜血的主宰者，展示你自己！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"停下，血魔！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Logos先生，坚持住——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"漆黑的术法从女孩的手中迸发而出，分开血海。\n\\n可血液不屈服，血液在怒吼。\n\\n魔王的术法分解破碎，红色激扬得更盛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喔，“魔王”。我都忘了你还在这。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"卡特斯，“魔王”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"瞧瞧你，你甚至没得到我的哪怕一丝恩荣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"卡特斯的血，冗厌，普通，就算我已经千方百计地打捞，也寻不到一点点才干与力量。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我甚至不愿说你的血是污浊或驳杂，这些形容词所包含的，仍是重回纯然的期许。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"诚然有混乱的血脉令我赞同，但他们无疑，都“强大”，都“壮美”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你又有什么？可笑的动机？浅薄的信仰？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我不需要回答你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只需要打败你。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这就是“魔王”？不过是窃取些微旁人的造诣，杂乱，无序。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还不如那位女妖出于叛逆的心理自创的小玩意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——更不如那对兄妹分毫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米娅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不要被他挑衅。此时此刻，他的力量仍在增长。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"速战速决。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我明白。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们要重新回到晴空之下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......过去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我曾杀死过一位所谓的“魔王”，并不困难。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而这次，你的下场也会一样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你以漆黑的刀斧质疑我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我则以赠你死亡作为回应。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
